This promises to be a moderate challenge, with learning objectives of:
- Investigate attacks against critical infrastructure and SCADA systems
- Trace malware execution from phishing download through C2 beaconing
- Identify lateral movement using PsExec and administrative credentials
- Recognize destructive malware (KillDisk) used to wipe systems
- Attribute attacks to nation-state actors using threat intelligence research
- Understand the attack chain behind real-world power grid attacks
- Identify credential theft through password file searches
- Find anti-forensic techniques like event log clearing

https://kc7cyber.com/challenges/279

